[h1]1.1 - Initial Release (1.1.x Fix)[/h1]

[list]
[*]Updated [b]supported_game_version[/b] to [b]1.1.*[/b], eliminating the launcher incompatibility warning
[*]Fixed [b]AI auto-marry[/b]: the on_actions for AI countries were defined but never wired into [i]monthly_country_pulse[/i], so the feature never fired
[*]Added missing [b]hint localization keys[/b] required by the situation system (caused log spam in 1.1.x)
[*]Fixed a [b]localization typo[/b] (missing closing quote in noble_auto_marry.1.t)
[*]Fixed [b]royal marriage reminders[/b] (event 57) ignoring the hide notifications setting
[*]Added a separate [b]royal marriage reminder toggle[/b] so players can suppress royal reminders independently from regular auto-marry notifications
[/list]
